d=\"f3093f3\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" src=\"https:\/\/hdmarine.com.tr\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/01\/hd-mar1212-300x300.jpg\" class=\"attachment-medium size-medium wp-image-2551\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/hdmarine.com.tr\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/01\/hd-mar1212-300x300.jpg 300w, https:\/\/hdmarine.com.tr\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/01\/hd-mar1212-150x150.jpg 150w, https:\/\/hdmarine.com.tr\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/01\/hd-mar1212-100x100.jpg 100w, https:\/\/hdmarine.com.tr\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/01\/hd-mar1212.jpg 500w\" sizes=\"100vw\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-87ae380 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"87ae380\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-dcb5617 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"dcb5617\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-f1a3597 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"f1a3597\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><strong>Diyaframlı pompalar<\/strong>, elastik bir diyafram sayesinde sıvıyı mekanik temas olmadan transfer eden pozitif deplasmanlı pompalar olarak endüstriyel proseslerde yüksek verim ve dayanıklılık sağlar. Toz, kir ve parçacık içeren akışkanlarda dahi performans düşmeden çalışabilmesiyle öne çıkar.<\/p><p>Bu pompalar, <strong>yüksek viskoziteli, aşındırıcı veya kirli sıvıların<\/strong> güvenli ve kontrollü taşınmasında ideal çözüm sunar. Marin ve endüstriyel ortamlarda sıvı transfer hattı güvenliğini en üst düzeye çıkarmak için tasarlanmıştır.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-d6180a8 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"d6180a8\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-fae61e2 elementor-view-stacked elementor-position-inline-start elementor-tablet-position-inline-end elementor-shape-circle elementor-mobile-position-block-start elementor-widget elementor-widget-icon-box\" data-id=\"fae61e2\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"icon-box.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-icon-box-wrapper\">\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-icon-box-icon\">\n\t\t\t\t<span  class=\"elementor-icon\">\n\t\t\t\t<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"e-font-icon-svg e-fas-table\" viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M464 32H48C21.49 32 0 53.49 0 80v352c0 26.51 21.49 48 48 48h416c26.51 0 48-21.49 48-48V80c0-26.51-21.49-48-48-48zM224 416H64v-96h160v96zm0-160H64v-96h160v96zm224 160H288v-96h160v96zm0-160H288v-96h160v96z\"><\/path><\/svg>\t\t\t\t<\/span>\n\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-icon-box-content\">\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"elementor-icon-box-title\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span  >\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDiyaframlı Pompa Teknik Değer Tablosu\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/h3>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-84b0e73 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"84b0e73\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<table width=\"514\"><tbody><tr><td width=\"185\">Özellik<\/td><td width=\"329\">Değer<\/td><\/tr><tr><td width=\"185\">Pompa Tipi<\/td><td width=\"329\">Pozitif Deplasmanlı Diyaframlı<\/td><\/tr><tr><td width=\"185\">Debi Aralığı<\/td><td width=\"329\">5 – 1000 L\/dk<\/td><\/tr><tr><td width=\"185\">Maksimum Basınç<\/td><td width=\"329\">8 bar<\/td><\/tr><tr><td width=\"185\">Çalışma Tipi<\/td><td width=\"329\">Havalı \/ Elektrikli<\/td><\/tr><tr><td width=\"185\">Parçacık Geçişi<\/td><td width=\"329\">2 – 10 mm<\/td><\/tr><tr><td width=\"185\">Gövde Malzemesi<\/td><td width=\"329\">PP \/ PVDF \/ Alüminyum \/ Paslanmaz<\/td><\/tr><tr><td width=\"185\">Diyafram Malzemesi<\/td><td width=\"329\">PTFE \/ Santoprene \/ Neopren \/ EPDM \/ Buna-N \/ Viton<\/td><\/tr><tr><td width=\"185\">Bağlantı Çapı<\/td><td width=\"329\">½” – 3”<\/td><\/tr><tr><td width=\"185\">Çalışma Sıcaklığı<\/td><td width=\"329\">5°C – 95°C<\/td><\/tr><\/tbody><\/table>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-f019175 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-child\" data-id=\"f019175\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-2c86b97 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"2c86b97\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-b0395ee e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-child\" data-id=\"b0395ee\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-6a05313 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"6a05313\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Kullanım Alanları<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div cl